[24.624, "o", "\r\n"]
[24.674, "o", "If you are trapped under rubble, tap steadily on a pipe or a wall so rescuers can hear you.\r\n"]
[24.724, "o", "Do not shout unless you have no other option: shouting wastes energy and makes you breathe\r\n"]
[24.774, "o", "in dangerous dust. Cover your mouth with cloth to filter the air.\r\n"]
